  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Hello Mr. Chang, I "
        },
        {
          "text": "live",
          "wordIds": [
            "live"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " in apartment 4B and I am "
        },
        {
          "text": "calling about a plumbing issue",
          "phraseIds": [
            "calling-about-a-plumbing-issue"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "張先生您好，我住在 4B 公寓，我打電話來是要反映水電管線的問題。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/reporting-water-leak/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "1eefc1167824c0a65037b919cc09a8f6d75a24f288ae253b365d096c67f69b68",
        "sha256": "1c6ca635484e712aa5303e33bbc012abfd12cbacb0e9430577c073acd8ac9542"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The metal "
        },
        {
          "text": "pipe",
          "wordIds": [
            "pipe"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "text": "beneath the bathroom ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "beneath-the-bathroom-sink"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sink",
          "phraseIds": [
            "beneath-the-bathroom-sink"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "sink"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " has "
        },
        {
          "text": "started to ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "started-to-leak-clean-water"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "leak",
          "phraseIds": [
            "started-to-leak-clean-water"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "leak"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " clean water",
          "phraseIds": [
            "started-to-leak-clean-water"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "浴室洗手台下方的金屬水管開始在滴漏乾淨的水了。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/reporting-water-leak/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "5abbee64e268861d09ac6ecde1835e16325d1ac139ecbfe13d452c7a506eb5a0",
        "sha256": "87bd8c4c4c37644e650c8a344b92dcd2d3706350a029af16e61e01b5d2afe61e"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Is the dripping water "
        },
        {
          "text": "bothering",
          "wordIds": [
            "bother"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " the floor or causing puddles in the room?"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "滴水會不會影響到地板，或者在室內造成積水呢？",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/reporting-water-leak/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "471e333326fc13c95176f66d22cecf501595b356248f57dfb82b9cb52495e86e",
        "sha256": "d76d625e498ede93e4c8282aa19626ea1716b0b8e145e63882aba294a17dcffc"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Yes, I "
        },
        {
          "text": "placed a plastic bucket",
          "phraseIds": [
            "placed-a-plastic-bucket"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " underneath, but it fills up every four hours."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "是的，我在下面放了一個塑膠水桶，但每四個小時水就會裝滿。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/reporting-water-leak/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "27a42df6a2a4b430e2b380b77529ff94392c190085614156f48c168320b8bad2",
        "sha256": "e7fb36fcd7dcae4ad0263dfaa0429e222ae60519fe479faec00a212c89492576"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I am sorry for the trouble, I will call a plumber to "
        },
        {
          "text": "fix",
          "phraseIds": [
            "fix-it-this-afternoon"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "fix"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " it this afternoon",
          "phraseIds": [
            "fix-it-this-afternoon"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "很抱歉造成你的困擾，我今天下午會請水電師傅去修理它。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/reporting-water-leak/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "05f5bfe0173d452d98fe00fc6d116b89b46f3058dea07c2abebdc85546f7cf60",
        "sha256": "48fb209f6eaf2ca234583a90825ad824647158f6e599b73a321a57931d69bed7"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Thank you very much, I will stay inside to let the repair technician in."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "非常謝謝您，我會待在屋內替維修技術人員開門。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/reporting-water-leak/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "9596d7c86f549178f20fd5ddf0c86404c1b4d35a600c955606d973b2e3553a7b",
        "sha256": "54892298ee0c06192f2ca7b7a196e28bca02e87d0f470d9f51aa89c9359b3155"
      }
    }
  ]
